  "instructions": [
    "Heat oil in a large paella pan or skillet over medium-high heat.",
    "Add onion and garlic, cook until softened, about 3 minutes.",
    "Add tomato paste and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add lentils, rice, paprika, and broth. Stir to combine.",
    "Bring to a boil, then reduce heat to low and simmer, covered, for 20-25 minutes.",
